      "id": "is-base-of",
      "name": "IsBaseOf",
      "category": "VersePath",
      "signature": "IsBaseOf(Target, Other, Out Leaf Path)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "UE*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Other",
          "type": "FVersePath&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Out Leaf Path",
          "type": "FStringView*",
          "default": "nullptr"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "nodiscard ] ] bool",
      "docs": "Tests whether this Verse path is a base Verse path of Other\nExamples:\n\"/domain1/path1\", \"/domain1/path1\" -> true, \"\"\n\"/domain1/path1\", \"/domain1/path1/leaf\" -> true, \"leaf\"\n\"/domain1/path1\", \"/domain1/path1/path2/leaf\" -> true, \"path2/leaf\"\n\"/domain1/path1\", \"/domain1/path2/leaf\" -> false, \"\"\n\"/domain1/path1\", \"/domain2/path1/leaf\" -> false, \"\"\n@param Other The Verse path to test against\n@param OutLeafPath The path segment of Other that is relative to this Verse path, ommiting the leading '/'. Empty if the two Verse paths are equal\n@return true if Other is relative or equal to this Verse path"
    },
